{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"921a220806f68d66de57b27dd59223eb1b066e8d56be04c3105a8636a6e23e70","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1290},"chapter":{"number":28,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["對北國的警告"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"禍哉！以法蓮的酒徒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"住在肥美谷的山上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們心裏高傲，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以所誇的為冠冕，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"猶如將殘之花。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看哪，主有一大能大力者，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像一陣冰雹，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像毀滅的暴風，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像漲溢的大水，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他必用手將冠冕摔落於地。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以法蓮高傲的酒徒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的冠冕必被踏在腳下。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那榮美將殘之花，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是在肥美谷山上的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必像夏令以前初熟的無花果；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看見這果的就注意，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"一到手中就吞吃了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"到那日，萬軍之耶和華","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必作他餘剩之民的榮冠華冕，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也作了在位上行審判者公平之靈，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"並城門口打退仇敵者的力量。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["以賽亞和猶大酒醉的先知"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"就是這地的人也因酒搖搖晃晃，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因濃酒東倒西歪。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祭司和先知因濃酒搖搖晃晃，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被酒所困，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因濃酒東倒西歪。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們錯解默示，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"謬行審判。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為各席上滿了嘔吐的污穢，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"無一處乾淨。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"譏誚先知的說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他要將知識指教誰呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要使誰明白傳言呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是那剛斷奶離懷的嗎？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他竟命上加命，令上加令，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"律上加律，例上加例，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這裏一點，那裏一點。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"先知說：不然，主要藉異邦人的嘴唇","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"和外邦人的舌頭對這百姓說話。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他曾對他們說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要使疲乏人得安息，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這樣才得安息，才得舒暢，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們卻不肯聽。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以，耶和華向他們說的話是","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"命上加命，令上加令，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"律上加律，例上加例，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這裏一點，那裏一點，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以致他們前行仰面跌倒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"而且跌碎，並陷入網羅被纏住。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["錫安的房角石"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"所以，你們這些褻慢的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是轄管住在耶路撒冷這百姓的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要聽耶和華的話。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們曾說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們與死亡立約，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"與陰間結盟；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"敵軍","poem":1},{"noteId":25},{"text":"如水漲漫經過的時候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必不臨到我們；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因我們以謊言為避所，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在虛假以下藏身。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以，主耶和華如此說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看哪，我在錫安放一塊石頭作為根基，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是試驗過的石頭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是穩固根基，寶貴的房角石；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"信靠的人必不着急。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必以公平為準繩，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以公義為線鉈。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"冰雹必沖去謊言的避所；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大水必漫過藏身之處。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們與死亡所立的約必然廢掉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"與陰間所結的盟必立不住。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"敵軍","poem":1},{"noteId":26},{"text":"如水漲漫經過的時候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們必被他踐踏；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"每逢經過必將你們擄去。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為每早晨他必經過，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"白晝黑夜都必如此。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"明白傳言的必受驚恐。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"原來，床榻短，使人不能舒身；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被窩窄，使人不能遮體。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華必興起，像在毗拉心山；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他必發怒，像在基遍谷，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好做成他的工，就是非常的工；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"成就他的事，就是奇異的事。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"現在你們不可褻慢，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"恐怕捆你們的綁索更結實了；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為我從主－萬軍之耶和華那裏聽見，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"已經決定在全地上施行滅絕的事。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["上帝的智慧"]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"text":"你們當側耳聽我的聲音，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"留心聽我的言語。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那耕地為要撒種的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"豈是常常耕地呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"豈是常常開墾耙地呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他拉平了地面，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"豈不就撒種小茴香，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"播種大茴香，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"按行列種小麥，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在定處種大麥，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在田邊種粗麥呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為他的上帝教導他務農相宜，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"並且指教他。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":[{"text":"原來打小茴香，不用尖利的器具，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"軋大茴香，也不用碌碡","poem":1},{"noteId":27},{"text":"；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但用杖打小茴香，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用棍打大茴香。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"做餅的糧食是用磨磨碎，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因它不必常打；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雖用碌碡和馬打散，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"卻不磨它。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":29,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這也是出於萬軍之耶和華－","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的謀略奇妙；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的智慧廣大。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":25,"caller":"-","text":"原文是鞭子","reference":{"chapter":28,"verse":15}},{"noteId":26,"caller":"-","text":"原文是鞭子","reference":{"chapter":28,"verse":18}},{"noteId":27,"caller":"-","text":"原文是車輪；下同","reference":{"chapter":28,"verse":27}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/28.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/29.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/27.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":29}